          "note": "\"references to anything outside are kept\" (DESIGN §4.1); the row template is outside the card's subtree."
        },
        {
          "type": "cell",
          "object": "fb1",
          "cell": "template",
          "value": {
            "type": "ref",
            "object": "fireball"
          },
          "note": "\"The copy's template cell points back at the original\" (DESIGN §4.1)."
        },
        {
          "type": "cell",
          "object": "zone1",
          "cell": "template",
          "value": {
            "type": "ref",
            "object": "fireball_zone"
          },
          "note": "The zone copy's template is the original zone (FORMULAS §8.3 spawn sets template)."
