    },
    {
      "actor": "aldric",
      "note": "Group 1. \"in play the zone is dragged out onto the board, and zone keeps pointing at it.\" The circle at [10, 10] radius 4 covers x 6..14 on the y=10 line: goblin1 (x=9) and goblin2 (x=12) inside, goblin3 (x=16) and Aldric (x=2) outside.",
